            <ArticleTitle>[A rare cause of acute abdomen: perforation of cecal diverticulum].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>332-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Authors, after a brief review of the literature on the frequency and localization of large bowel diverticular disease report a case of perforation of a cecal diverticulum operated on emergency. They also add some brief comments on the interesting aspects of the case, its diagnostic difficulties and operating technique.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
